Create one compact status icon for the mandatory, fixed ROCK ammunition card
in the Urkaaaz Loadout.

## References

- Attach `assets_src/loadout/ui/loadout_unlimited_icon.png` as the primary
  visual-style reference. Match its compact scale, warm gold/ivory palette,
  clean silhouette, and transparent treatment.
- Attach `assets_src/loadout/ui/loadout_card_locked.png` only as a reference
  for the recognizable padlock shape. Do not copy its grayscale treatment,
  large overlay scale, or card-overlay composition.
- The output is a small fixed-slot marker for ROCK. It does not mean that ROCK
  is unavailable, level-locked, or inaccessible.

## Art direction

- Draw one clearly recognizable, closed padlock as the only motif.
- Use a polished warm-gold and ivory finish consistent with the infinity
  icon, with enough contrast to remain legible at 16-20 dp on dark card art.
- Keep the lock simple and compact. Use a solid, readable body and shackle;
  avoid delicate lines that disappear when scaled down.
- Center the icon and leave a small, even transparent margin on every side.
- Preserve clean edges and full transparency outside the icon.
- Do not add a circle, badge, border, backing plate, card, glow that obscures
  the silhouette, text, letters, numbers, keyhole lettering, or extra ornament.
- The icon is presentation-only. It must not imply that ROCK is unavailable
  or change any Loadout selection behavior.

## Output

- Output exactly one PNG: `loadout_rock_locked_icon.png`.
- Canvas: 128 x 128 pixels, RGBA, transparent background.
- Save the file for review under `assets_src/loadout/ui/`.
- Do not copy it into Android resources until the user approves the preview.

## Review checklist

- Verify the output is a valid 128 x 128 RGBA PNG with transparent background.
- Confirm the padlock is immediately recognizable at 16 dp on both dark and
  bright card backgrounds.
- Check that its visual weight and gold/ivory treatment match the infinity
  icon without being mistaken for the centered grayscale unavailable-lock
  overlay.
- Ensure the image contains no text, background, UI, watermark, or stray marks.
- Show the icon preview for user review before Android integration.

## Negative prompt

text, letters, numbers, words, infinity symbol, key, open lock, padlock with
tiny unreadable details, circle, badge, border, backing plate, card frame,
UI, screenshot, gray unavailable overlay, background, opaque canvas, glow
obscuring silhouette, watermark, signature, extra symbols, unrelated
franchise, photorealism, 3D UI mockup
